The configuration model, the six-step context processing pipeline, the
child-context isolation and the DynamicDataSource hot-swap design are derived
from microsphere-dynamic. This product is an independent port: it upgrades the
baseline to Spring Boot 3.2.5 / ShardingSphere 5.5.1 / MyBatis 3.0.5 /
MyBatis-Plus 3.5.7, removes all microsphere artifact dependencies (replaced by
the self-written support package), rewrites the ShardingSphere integration
around YamlShardingSphereDataSourceFactory, adapts the event integration to
PolyConfig and PolyZone, and ships a rewritten H2-based test suite.
